# Netlify.
#
# Every real route is prerendered to a static file, and Netlify serves matching
# static files before consulting this file — so /fleet, /about etc. resolve on
# their own and need no rewrite here.
#
# Deliberately NOT a `/*  /index.html  200` SPA fallback: that would answer
# every unknown URL with the homepage under a 200, which search engines treat
# as a soft 404. Sending them to the real 404 page with a 404 status is correct.
/*  /404.html  404
